### Register beneficiary
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/beneficiaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Rahul Sharma",
  "govId": "345678901234",
  "contact": "9876543210",
  "email": "rahul.sharma@example.com",
  "age": 28,
  "address": "Kothrud, Pune",
  "schemeName": "Agriculture Subsidy"
}


### Create Scheme
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/schemes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schemeName": "TEST SCHEME",
  "description": "Test government subsidy scheme",
  "minAge": 18,
  "maxAge": 60,
  "maxAnnualIncome": 500000,
  "maxLandHolding": 5,
  "requiredCategory": "ALL",
  "grantAmount": 10000,
  "active": true
}

### Get all schemes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/schemes

### Get scheme by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/schemes/4

### Get active schemes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/schemes/active

### Update Scheme
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/schemes/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schemeName": "UPDATED TEST SCHEME",
  "description": "Updated government subsidy scheme",
  "minAge": 21,
  "maxAge": 60,
  "maxAnnualIncome": 600000,
  "maxLandHolding": 10,
  "requiredCategory": "ALL",
  "grantAmount": 15000,
  "active": true
}

### Deactivate Scheme
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/schemes/4

### Verify deactivated scheme
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/schemes/4

### Verify active schemes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/schemes/active

### Submit scheme application
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "beneficiaryId": 1,
  "schemeId": 1
}

### Verify application - Field Officer

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/applications/1/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verifiedBy": "FIELD_OFFICER_01",
  "remarks": "Beneficiary documents verified successfully",
  "approved": true
}

### Submit new application

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "beneficiaryId": 1,
  "schemeId": 1
}

